exit: 0
--- stdout
commandments scaffold — Generate the reusable helper a sin's fix uses — written into your source root with its namespace injected. Idempotent: an existing file is skipped.

Usage:
  commandments scaffold             generate every sin's scaffold that is missing
  commandments scaffold --sin=NAME  generate one sin's scaffold (lenient name match)

Options:
  --sin=NAME  only scaffold for this sin
  --dry-run   print what would be created, and its contents, without writing

